    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Concept.</strong> The Menhir Kin do not build vehicles so much as convince a standing stone to walk. Slow. Implacable. The kind of slow that arrives anyway. It does not skip encounters; it absorbs them.</p>\n<p><strong>Signature.</strong> A fortress that travels badly and holds excellently. When it finally stops, the ground is grateful and the enemy is not.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
